附加说明 / Additional Notes:
- `research/` 目录中的资料为网络公开内容的调研归档，版权归各原作者所有，仅供研究交流。
  Materials under `research/` are archived for research purposes; copyright
  belongs to their original authors.
- `saves/` 目录为玩家自愿分享的游戏存档。
  Saves under `saves/` are shared voluntarily by the player.
- 本仓库不包含任何游戏本体文件；游戏版权归其权利人所有。
  This repository contains no game ROM/ISO files.
